  "details": "I know many others have requested similar or close to the exact, but there needs to be an option with avatar creators to be able to age gate avatars they make. So for example, if someone who isn't age verified tries to clone an age verified avatar, it gives them an error message saying that the avatar is for age verified only. But even then, I don't think they should be able to see the 18+ avatar in the first place, maybe the person not age verified would see their fallback avatar",
